<title>SINGAPORE: Datacraft, Gen.Datacomm in US$30-40 mln alliance.</title>
<headline>Datacraft, Gen.Datacomm in US$30-40 mln alliance.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore-based data communications company Datacraft Asia Ltd and General Datacomm Industries Inc of the U.S. announced on Friday a three-year US$30-40 million partnership to supply telecommunications switching equipment in Asia.</p>
</text>
